Run the workato-watchdog agent procedure: connection health, stalled-scheduler detection, failure autopsies (dev workspace only). Read-only: report, never stop/start/edit anything. Write the report to ~/.claude/knowledge/watchdog-reports/$(date +%F).md (append if it exists, newest section on top). If nothing needs attention, write a three-line "all clear" section. Keep findings actionable per Josh's rule: what broke, is it new, what's next.
